  "commit_message": "Place batch 207: third K215 proof-simplification packet, retire its archive\n\nK215_Proof_Simplification_2026-10-21(1).zip (arrival beaabc8e3b): finite replays and uncompiled drafts for the K215 endpoints (equal 1,426-node increment-count CFGs of the two source programs, ordered CFGs differing by 256 adjacent increment swaps from two DAG templates, canonical checkpoint rows, packed Rocq certificate and Lean symmetry/canonical-row drafts, a comparison of alternatives). Placed byte-identical as k225-formal/verification/k215/simplification/proposals/k215-simplification-3/, omitting lean/snapshot/ (730 files mirroring this repository) and new_intake/gc_zc215/received.zip (batch 204's archive); logs stay out by the ignore rules. Its only table not in the repository, common-pop215, is a comparison input from an undelivered packet with no proof here, not placed as an alternative. Nothing rerun; the queue is clear.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
